%% 意图是分层信号 + 硬门禁，不是单一路由器
flowchart TD
  Q[用户问题] --> Cap{"能力自检?"}
  Cap -->|是| List[直接返回能力清单]
  Cap -->|否| Funnel[确定性漏斗]
  Funnel --> Inherit[省略句继承]
  Inherit --> Dec[intent_decision]
  Dec --> Hint[Supervisor prompt 顾问]
  Dec --> Gate[web_authorized 硬门禁]
  Hint --> Del[delegate_to 选择 Worker]
  Gate --> Mid[registry + capability]
  Mid --> Act[拒绝 / HITL / 执行]
